Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.09,0:01:53.42,Title,0,0,0,0,,《行尸走肉》
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.96,0:00:07.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你们是谁 - 你们又是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Who the hell are you? - Who the hell are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.78,0:00:09.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,他失血太多 我们必须回去\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's bleeding out. We gotta go back.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.90,0:00:12.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,过来 用力按住膝盖\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come around here. Put pressure on the knee.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.09,0:00:14.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,用力 用力按\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hard, hard! Push, push.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.92,0:00:16.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,从后面出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, outta there.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.34,0:00:17.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,慢慢走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Slow and steady.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.29,0:00:20.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,他怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened to him?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.53,0:00:22.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他被咬了 - 被咬\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He got bit. - Bit?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.20,0:00:23.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,别激动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa, whoa, whoa. Easy now.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.31,0:00:25.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有动武的必要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nobody needs get hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.63,0:00:27.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你使劲按住 - 好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I need you to hold this. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.53,0:00:29.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 用最大力 - 是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- As hard as you can. - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.72,0:00:31.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们有医疗品吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have medical supplies?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.33,0:00:32.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁允许你过去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa, where do you think you're going?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.56,0:00:38.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们到底是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who the hell are you people, anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.39,0:00:40.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们可不像救援队\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't look like no rescue team.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.32,0:00:43.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,别妄想等到救援队了\N{\fnArial\fs30}If a rescue team is what you're waiting for, don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.82,0:00:46.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,快 得走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, we gotta go.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.83,0:00:49.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,过来 帮把手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now! Come on! I need a hand here.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.60,0:00:50.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,一二三 走\N{\fnArial\fs30}One, two, three, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.89,0:00:54.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 老天 - T仔 开门\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Holy Jesus! - T, the door.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.30,0:00:56.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你疯了吗 不能开 - 别妨碍我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Are you crazy? Don't open that! - We got this.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.57,0:01:04.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,达里尔 达里尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Daryl. Daryl!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.48,0:01:09.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.92,0:01:11.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,这边\N{\fnArial\fs30}This way.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.66,0:01:57.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,这边走\N{\fnArial\fs30}This way, this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.77,0:01:59.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,不不 快后退\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no. Back, back!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.74,0:02:00.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,达里尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Daryl.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.10,0:02:07.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟上 快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on! Go, go, go.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.86,0:02:25.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心 注意点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watch out, watch out.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.13,0:02:26.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,都停下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop, stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.50,0:02:27.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟着他们的光走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Follow the flashlight.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.41,0:02:29.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.01,0:02:33.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走 走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go. Go, go, go.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.47,0:02:40.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,稳住\N{\fnArial\fs30}Easy, easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.32,0:02:43.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他失血太多了 - 快开门\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He's losing too much blood. - Open the door!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.96,0:02:44.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,赫谢尔出事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's Hershel!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.99,0:02:46.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡尔 快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carl! Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.55,0:02:47.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 天啊 - 爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, my God. - Daddy!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.97,0:02:49.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,快到里面去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go, go, go, go, go. In there.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.57,0:02:50.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,这边\N{\fnArial\fs30}This way.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.81,0:02:53.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,抬到床上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get him on the bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.35,0:02:56.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,他被咬了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He got bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.23,0:02:57.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 老天 他会变成行尸 - 你们把腿砍了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, my God, he's gonna turn. - Did you cut it off?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.41,0:02:59.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是的 - 也许还来得及\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah. - Maybe you got it in time.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.20,0:03:00.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 准备 - 好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Ready? - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.78,0:03:02.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,一 二 三\N{\fnArial\fs30}One, two, three.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.05,0:03:07.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, God.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.09,0:03:12.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要绷带\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I need bandages.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.12,0:03:14.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 医疗品都用完了 - 那就找点别的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We used everything we had. - Well, get more. Anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.36,0:03:16.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡尔 去把我床边的毛巾拿来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carl, go get the towels from the back, right next to my bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.17,0:03:19.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他会变行尸吗 - 他会没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Is he gonna turn? - He's gonna be okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.59,0:03:20.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能稳住他的伤情吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think you can stabilize him?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.70,0:03:22.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,得把他的腿抬高\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need to keep his leg elevated.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.46,0:03:23.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿些枕头来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get some pillows!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.91,0:03:25.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,床单已经被血浸透了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's already bled through the sheets.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.39,0:03:28.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以用火烧伤口止血 我来点火\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can burn the wound to clot the blood. I can start a fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.00,0:03:30.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 求你不要 - 不行 用火烧他挺不住的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No, please don't do this. - No, the shock could kill him.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.08,0:03:31.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且没法止住动脉出血\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not gonna stop the artery from bleeding.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.93,0:03:34.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们只能尽力止血让它自然愈合\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need to just keep it dressed and let it heal on its own.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.60,0:04:01.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,别再靠近\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's far enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.71,0:04:03.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,C单元区\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cell block C.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.89,0:04:06.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我住在4号牢房 美国佬\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cell 4… that's mine, gringo.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.54,0:04:07.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me in.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.98,0:04:09.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们哥几个今天运气不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Today's your lucky days, fellas.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.97,0:04:12.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,乔治亚州赦免了你们 你们可以走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've been pardoned by the state of Georgia. You are free to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.68,0:04:13.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,里面情况怎样\N{\fnArial\fs30}What you got going on in there?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.93,0:04:15.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,与你无关\N{\fnArial\fs30}It ain't none of your concern.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.48,0:04:17.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,这可不是你说了算\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't be telling me what's my concern.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.54,0:04:20.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,冷静 伙计 那家伙腿都毁了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chill, man. Dude's leg is messed up.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.06,0:04:22.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,再说咱都自由了 还留这干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Besides, we're free now. Why are we still in here?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.67,0:04:23.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说得对\N{\fnArial\fs30}The man's got a point.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.64,0:04:25.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也想去找我老婆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, and I gotta check on my old lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.12,0:04:27.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,普通市民突然之间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oops, civilians break into a prison,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.26,0:04:28.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,闯入监狱\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you got no business being in…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.42,0:04:31.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想这说明已经没其他地方可去了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}got me thinking there ain't no place for us to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.75,0:04:34.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你可以出去看看 - 我们正要去呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Why don't you go find out? - Maybe we'll just be going now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.57,0:04:36.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们不走 - 也不能进来\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey, we ain't leaving. - You ain't coming in either.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.49,0:04:38.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的地盘我做主\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's my house, my rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.85,0:04:40.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爱去哪儿去哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}I go where I damn will please.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.65,0:04:43.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那是谁 - 幸存的犯人\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What was that? - Prisoners, survivors.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.78,0:04:46.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么 - 没事 大家别动\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - It's all right. Everybody stay put.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.19,0:04:52.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,守在他身边\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do not leave his side.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.51,0:04:57.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果他死了 你要准备好善后\N{\fnArial\fs30}If he dies, you need to be there for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.49,0:04:59.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,能做到吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think you can do this?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.50,0:05:03.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 玛姬也会在那 - 我可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Maggie will be there. - I got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.24,0:05:05.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 要不让我T仔来… - 我可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I can bring T in here… - I got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.51,0:05:08.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.20,0:05:16.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里不欢迎你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}There ain't nothing for you here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.46,0:05:17.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们怎么不回之前那坑里蹲着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't you go back to your own sandbox?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.59,0:05:21.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,都放松 没必要这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everyone relax. There's no need for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.77,0:05:22.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们有多少人\N{\fnArial\fs30}How many of you are in there?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.79,0:05:24.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,比你想象的多\N{\fnArial\fs30}Too many for you to handle.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.25,0:05:27.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们是不是抢了银行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you rob a bank or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.04,0:05:29.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么不带他去正规医院\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't you take him to a hospital?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.27,0:05:38.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们在食堂困了多久\N{\fnArial\fs30}How long have you been locked in that cafeteria?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.17,0:05:42.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,十个月了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Going on like 10 months.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.31,0:05:46.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,监狱暴动了\N{\fnArial\fs30}A riot broke out.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.26,0:05:48.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,从没见过那样的暴动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never seen anything like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.75,0:05:50.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\an8}阿提卡暴动 1971年震惊全美的监狱暴动
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.36,0:05:53.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,听说过人变成食人魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ever heard about dudes going cannibal,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.21,0:05:54.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,死而复生吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}dying, coming back to life?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.90,0:05:55.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,太疯狂了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.41,0:05:58.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个狱警为了保护我们 把我们锁在食堂\N{\fnArial\fs30}One guard looked out for us, locked us up in the cafeteria.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.80,0:05:59.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我们别动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Told us to sit tight,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.90,0:06:01.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,给了我这把枪 说他马上回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}throw me this piece and he'd be right back.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.93,0:06:04.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,但已经过了292天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, and that was 292 days ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.21,0:06:06.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 据我计算是294… - 闭嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}- 94 accdiding to my calcula… - Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.82,0:06:09.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们本以为军队或国民警卫队\N{\fnArial\fs30}We were thinking that the Army or the National Guard.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.95,0:06:11.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,很快会来救我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}should be showing up any day now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.22,0:06:13.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有军队了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is no Army.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.32,0:06:15.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.35,0:06:19.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有政府 没有医院 没有警察\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no government, no hospitals, no police.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.38,0:06:21.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,全没了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.79,0:06:24.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}For real?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.56,0:06:26.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.24,0:06:31.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我妈妈呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about my moms?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.16,0:06:35.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的孩子 还有我老婆呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}My kids? And my old lady?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.65,0:06:38.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有没有爪机什么的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yo, you got a cell phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.38,0:06:40.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我们给家里打个电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}or somomething that we can call our families?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.15,0:06:41.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还不明白吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You just don't get it, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.63,0:06:44.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,电话没用 电脑没用\N{\fnArial\fs30}No phones, no computers.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.99,0:06:48.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,就我们所知\N{\fnArial\fs30}As far as we can see,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.37,0:06:50.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,至少一半人都死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}at least half of the population has been wiped out.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.29,0:06:52.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,有可能更多\N{\fnArial\fs30}Probably more.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.90,0:07:01.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不可能 - 你自己看看去\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Ain't no way. - See for yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.02,0:07:23.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,阳光感觉真好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn, the sun feels good.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.74,0:07:27.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊 他们都死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good lord. They're all dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.56,0:07:31.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,从没想过再见到这些铁丝网我会这么高兴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never thought I'd be so happy to see these fences.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.84,0:07:37.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还没告诉我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}You never said…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.25,0:07:38.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们是怎么进来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}how the hell did you get in here in the first place?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.66,0:07:42.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,在那个警卫塔旁边的铁丝网上开了个洞\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cut a hole in that fence over there by that guard tower.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.18,0:07:45.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,有那么轻松吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}That easy, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.11,0:07:48.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,有志者事竟成\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where there's a will there's a way.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.15,0:07:49.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说起来倒容易\N{\fnArial\fs30}Easy for you to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.37,0:07:53.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,这到底怎么回事 传染病吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what is this, like a disease?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.68,0:07:57.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 而且我们都被感染了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, and we're all infected.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.56,0:08:00.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,被感染了是什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you mean infected?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.09,0:08:02.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,像艾滋病之类的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like aids or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.12,0:08:05.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我杀死你 冲着你胸脯来一箭\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I was to kill you, shoot an arrow in your chest,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.81,0:08:07.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就会变成这种东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}you'd come back as one of these things.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.71,0:08:10.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们所有人都会这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's gonna happen to all of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.39,0:08:14.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,这群三脚猫不可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ain't no way that these Robbin Hood cats are.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.84,0:08:16.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,干掉这么多怪物\N{\fnArial\fs30}responsible for killing all these freaks.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.97,0:08:18.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,外面至少有50具尸体\N{\fnArial\fs30}Must be 50 bodies out here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.91,0:08:23.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你从哪来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where'd you come from?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.92,0:08:25.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,亚特兰大\N{\fnArial\fs30}Atlanta.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.95,0:08:29.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,要去哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are you headed?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.07,0:08:31.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,目前来看 哪也不去\N{\fnArial\fs30}For now, nowhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.42,0:08:41.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们可以在水源那边住下\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess you can take that area down there near the water.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.68,0:08:42.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,应该挺舒服的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Should be comfortable.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.62,0:08:45.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要用那片地来种庄稼\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're using that field for crops.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.45,0:08:46.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会帮你把东西搬出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll help you move your gear out.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.60,0:08:48.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That won't be necessary.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.53,0:08:51.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们消灭了这些行尸 这座监狱属于我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}We took out these walkers. This prison is ours.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.12,0:08:52.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,等会 小子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Slow down, cowboy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.61,0:08:54.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你弄坏了我们门上的锁\N{\fnArial\fs30}You snatched the locks off our doors.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.06,0:08:58.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你想的话 我们可以给你新锁\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll give you new locks, if that's how you want it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.15,0:09:01.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我们的监狱 我们先到这的\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is our prison. We were here first.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.25,0:09:02.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们是被锁在杂物间里吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Locked in a broom closet?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.55,0:09:06.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们攻下这里 还你们自由\N{\fnArial\fs30}We took it, set you free.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.24,0:09:08.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里属于我们 我们撒下了鲜血\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's ours. We spilled blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.44,0:09:10.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要搬回我们的牢房区\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're moving back into our cell block.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.12,0:09:11.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们只能重找一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll have to get your own.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.48,0:09:13.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,那本就是我的牢房区 里面还有我的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is mine. I've still got personal artifacts in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.48,0:09:15.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,横竖都归我\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's about as mine as it gets.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.24,0:09:18.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以想个两全其美的办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe let's try to make this work out so everybody wins.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.90,0:09:22.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我觉得没可能 - 我也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I don't see that happening. - Neither do I.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.55,0:09:25.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我死也不回那个食堂\N{\fnArial\fs30}I ain't going back in that cafeteria for one more minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.03,0:09:29.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有其他牢房区\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are other cell blocks.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.26,0:09:30.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也可以离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}You could leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.40,0:09:33.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,去外面碰碰运气\N{\fnArial\fs30}Try your luck out on the road.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.90,0:09:44.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果这三个娘娘腔能干掉这么多怪物\N{\fnArial\fs30}If these three pussies can do all this,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.93,0:09:47.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我们也能清理出一个牢房区\N{\fnArial\fs30}the least we can do is take out another cell block.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.40,0:09:48.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,用什么清理\N{\fnArial\fs30}With what?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.55,0:09:51.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,这位老兄会给我们一些真正的武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}Atlanta here will spot us some real weapons.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.68,0:09:52.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,对吗 「老大」\N{\fnArial\fs30}Won't you, boss?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.69,0:09:56.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,食堂的食物储备有多少\N{\fnArial\fs30}How stocked is that cafeteria?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.25,0:09:58.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,肯定有很多\N{\fnArial\fs30}It must have plenty of food.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.37,0:10:00.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,让你们五个维持了近一年\N{\fnArial\fs30}Five guys lasting almost a year?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.26,0:10:02.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们几个看着都没饿过\N{\fnArial\fs30}It sure as hell don't look like anybody's been starving.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.05,0:10:06.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 只剩一点了 - 我们要一半\N{\fnArial\fs30}- There's only a little left. - We'll take half.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.80,0:10:10.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,作为交换 我们帮你们清理出一个牢房区\N{\fnArial\fs30}In exchange, we'll help clear out a cell block.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.94,0:10:13.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没听见吗 只剩一点了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Didn't you hear him? There's only a little left.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.95,0:10:16.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,除了交换食物你们有别的选择吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bet you got more food than you got choices.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.40,0:10:19.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,交出食物 我们才帮你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You pay, we'll play.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.95,0:10:23.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们帮你清理 然后那区牢房归你\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll clear out a block for you then you keep to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.40,0:10:27.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.62,0:10:29.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我们先说清楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}But let's be clear…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.33,0:10:33.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我看见你动我的人一根毫毛\N{\fnArial\fs30}if we see you out here anywhere near our people,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.85,0:10:35.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,哪怕只闻到一点点你的气息\N{\fnArial\fs30}if I so much as even catch a whiff of your scent,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.88,0:10:37.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会杀了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.56,0:10:43.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,成交\N{\fnArial\fs30}Deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.85,0:10:49.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样能止住血吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}It has to stop eventually, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.96,0:10:51.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,已经不怎么流血了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It slowed down quite a bit already.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.06,0:10:58.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我们能帮他挺过这关\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we can get him through this…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.47,0:10:59.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can get him through this.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.85,0:11:02.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们需要准备拐杖了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll need crutches.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.69,0:11:05.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们现在需要抗生素\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right now we could use some antibiotics.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.89,0:11:09.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,止疼药 还有消毒纱布\N{\fnArial\fs30}and painkillers, some sterile gauze.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.41,0:11:10.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里应该有医务室\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's got to be an infirmary here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.98,0:11:12.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果有的话 我们会找到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}If there is, we'll find it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.75,0:11:16.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,这下生孩子就更不利了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's got to be worse about delivering the baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.10,0:11:20.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,看着我 我看起来担心吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at me. Do I look worried?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.37,0:11:24.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看起来又脏又恶心\N{\fnArial\fs30}You look disgusting.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.83,0:11:26.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}So do you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.92,0:11:30.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会挺过去的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll get through this.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.33,0:11:34.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,食物储藏室在后面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pantry's back here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.51,0:11:40.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们没试过从这里逃出去吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You never tried to break out of here?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.81,0:11:43.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们想把门卸掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, we tried to take the doors off.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.85,0:11:45.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是只要往外瞧一眼\N{\fnArial\fs30}But if you make one peep in here,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.61,0:11:48.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些怪物就会堆在门外\N{\fnArial\fs30}then those freaks'll be lined up outside the door growling,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.09,0:11:49.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘶吼着想要进来\N{\fnArial\fs30}trying to get in.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.97,0:11:52.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,窗户栏杆太坚固 黑巨人都掰不开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Windows got bars on there that He-Man couldn't get through.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.69,0:11:55.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 彪形大汉也没用 - 我没啥抱怨的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Bigger than a 5x8. - You won't find me complaining.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.43,0:11:58.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,坐了15年牢 睡觉左腿都得搭在外边\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doing 15. My left leg can barely fit on one of those bunks.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.16,0:12:01.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们叫他大块头就是这个原因\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, they don't call him Big Tiny for nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.63,0:12:03.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们扯够了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You done jerking each other off?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.58,0:12:04.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我都等半天了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sick of waiting back here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.39,0:12:33.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是你说的「一点食物」\N{\fnArial\fs30}This what you call a little bit of food?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.67,0:12:35.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,不经吃\N{\fnArial\fs30}Goes fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.20,0:12:38.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以分你一袋玉米 一些金枪鱼\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can have a bag of corn, some tuna fish…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.80,0:12:41.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们说的是一半 商量好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We said half. That's the deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.33,0:12:44.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 里面是什么 - 别打开\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What's in there? - Don't open that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.26,0:12:49.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,他自找的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He wanted to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.99,0:12:56.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,好想用我自己的尿壶撒尿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can't wait for my own pot to piss in.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.61,0:13:12.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,让他和我们一块去真是蠢死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was stupid of us to let him go.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.46,0:13:17.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,清空整间牢房 我们五个人就够了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We cleared this whole cell block, just the five of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.75,0:13:19.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,这事可能会发生在每个人身上\N{\fnArial\fs30}It could have happened to anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.73,0:13:25.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,没了他我们怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are we gonna do without him?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.57,0:13:28.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,别乱想\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.49,0:13:30.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吗 别想了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right? Stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.10,0:13:33.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,他还在\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's still here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.50,0:13:37.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果他醒过来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What if he does wake up?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.73,0:13:42.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后呢 他也不能走路了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then what? He can't even walk.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.30,0:13:43.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,而我们总是在逃跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}All we do is run.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.28,0:13:47.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个伤不会击垮他的\N{\fnArial\fs30}This won't break him.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.68,0:13:50.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.81,0:13:53.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,他还有你和贝丝\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's got you and Beth.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.81,0:13:56.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,难道我是唯一敢面对现实的人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Am I the only person living in reality here?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.26,0:14:02.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么多困难我们都挺过来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've been through so much already.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.59,0:14:04.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也觉得他不行了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're expecting it, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.10,0:14:08.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没有 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not expecting, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.63,0:14:09.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是以防万一\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am just preparing.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.12,0:14:13.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,不如你去看看贝丝怎样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't you go check on Beth?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.01,0:14:14.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,去吧 我会守着他的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go on. I'll watch him.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.36,0:14:36.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.47,0:14:37.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得他的裤子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think he had a hard time walking around.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.85,0:14:40.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,一边拖地 会很难走\N{\fnArial\fs30}with one side of his pants dragging on the ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.38,0:14:42.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,他可能会被绊倒之类的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, he could trip or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.92,0:14:50.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,很有可能他醒不过来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a good chance that he won't wake up.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.34,0:14:53.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你怎么能如此轻言放弃 - 我没放弃\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Why are you so eager to give up on him? - I'm not giving up on him.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.41,0:14:55.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的语气听起来就是\N{\fnArial\fs30}It sure sounds like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.64,0:14:58.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想让你抱有太大希望\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't want you to get your hopes too high.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.63,0:15:03.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们没有设备处理类似的情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're not equipped to deal with something like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.66,0:15:07.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们有卡萝尔 - 她不是医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We have Carol. - She's not a doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.95,0:15:10.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸只教过她怎么照顾婴儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad taught her a few things to help with the baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.83,0:15:12.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,可她止住血了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She stopped the bleeding.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.57,0:15:19.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样就好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}These'll do just fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.01,0:15:26.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 吃的来了 - 都有什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Food's here. - What you got?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.17,0:15:30.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,罐装牛肉 罐装玉米 全都是罐头\N{\fnArial\fs30}Canned beef, canned corn, canned cans.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.65,0:15:32.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,那里还有很多食物\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a lot more where this came from.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.66,0:15:34.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,情况有好转吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any change?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.23,0:15:36.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,血止住了 没有发烧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bleeding is under control and no fever,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.26,0:15:40.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,但呼吸很吃力 脉搏也非常低\N{\fnArial\fs30}but his breath is labored and his pulse is way down.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.21,0:15:41.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,他还没睁过眼\N{\fnArial\fs30}and he hasn't opened his eyes yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.26,0:15:45.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿出我的手铐 给他戴上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take my cuffs, put them on him.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.42,0:15:48.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会冒一点风险的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not taking any chances.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.77,0:15:57.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些囚犯怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what about those prisoners?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.93,0:15:59.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会帮他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna help them.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.72,0:16:01.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,清扫他们自己的单元区\N{\fnArial\fs30}clear out their own cell block,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.19,0:16:04.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后他们住那边 我们在这边\N{\fnArial\fs30}and then they'll be there and we'll be here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.14,0:16:07.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 同一屋檐下 - 我不会放弃这个监狱\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Living beside each other. - I'm not giving up this prison.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.14,0:16:08.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们有枪吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do they have guns?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.21,0:16:10.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只看见一把\N{\fnArial\fs30}I only saw one.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.92,0:16:16.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也不知道这可不可行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I don't know if it's gonna work.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.40,0:16:19.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还有别的选择吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, what are your options?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.64,0:16:23.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者杀了他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kill them.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.36,0:16:27.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你觉得那是最佳选择的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}If that's what you think is best.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.20,0:16:32.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你现在又说杀人没事…\N{\fnArial\fs30}You s… you say this now…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.17,0:16:36.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道我不是个好妻子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I know that I'm a shitty wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.72,0:16:39.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,也不是年度荣誉妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I'm not winning any mother of the year awards,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.27,0:16:45.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是你必须知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I need you to know that…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.07,0:16:50.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从来没觉得你心里有一丝歹意\N{\fnArial\fs30}not for one second do I think there is malice in your heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.21,0:16:54.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不是冷血杀手 这点我很清楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not a killer, and I know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.65,0:16:58.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道 所以\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know that, so…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.83,0:17:05.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了大家的安全 去做该做的事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}so do whatever you gotta do to keep this group safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.71,0:17:07.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,此事问心无愧\N{\fnArial\fs30}And do it with a clear conscience.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.48,0:17:27.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,能用枪 干嘛还用要这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why do I need this when I got this?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.85,0:17:29.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,除非你被逼到绝路\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't fire guns,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.72,0:17:31.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,否则不能开枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}not unless your back's up against a wall.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.47,0:17:33.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们循着声响来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Noise attracts them.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.17,0:17:35.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,这会惊动它们的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It really riles them up.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.67,0:17:39.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们两两一组 达里尔和T仔走前\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll go in two by two. Daryl will run point with T.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.55,0:17:42.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我和你善后\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll bring up the rear with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.08,0:17:45.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管行尸离你多近\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay tight, hold formation.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.08,0:17:47.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,都要守住位置 维持队形\N{\fnArial\fs30}close I'll bring up the walkers get…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.29,0:17:49.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,一人破坏队形 大家都有危险\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyone breaks ranks, we could all go down.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.27,0:17:50.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,有谁离队\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyone runs off,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.82,0:17:52.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,就可能被误认为行尸\N{\fnArial\fs30}they could get mistaken for a walker,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.33,0:17:55.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,死于头上利斧\N{\fnArial\fs30}end up with an axe to the head.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.18,0:17:56.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你需要的就是对准头部\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that's where you aim.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.72,0:17:58.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些行尸只有头部受伤才会真正死去\N{\fnArial\fs30}These things only go down with a head shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.75,0:18:00.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,用不着你告诉我们怎么杀人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You ain't gotta tell us how to take out a man.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.04,0:18:05.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们不是人 他们是别的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}They ain't men. They're something else.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.04,0:18:08.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,记住了 瞄准脑袋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just remember to go for the brain.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.38,0:18:20.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,发生了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.76,0:18:23.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们不得不这样 - 只是以防万一\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We had to. - It's just a precaution.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.14,0:18:31.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,能让我和他独处几分钟吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think maybe I could have a minute alone here?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.33,0:18:34.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你需要我陪…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, you want me to…?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.23,0:18:37.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用 就我一个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, just by myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.49,0:18:39.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.28,0:18:45.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就在外面\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll be right outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.53,0:19:17.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.20,0:19:23.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不用再坚持了\N{\fnArial\fs30}you don't have to fight anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.61,0:19:32.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不用担心我和贝丝\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you're worried about me and Beth, don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.60,0:19:34.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用担心我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't worry about us.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.52,0:19:39.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会彼此照顾 我们会当心的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll take care of each other. We'll look out.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.67,0:19:41.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我 贝丝和格伦都会小心的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me, Beth, and Glenn will look out.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.89,0:19:50.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,去吧 爸爸 没关系的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go ahead, Dad. It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.35,0:19:55.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,平静地去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Be peaceful.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.08,0:20:00.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不必继续战斗了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't have to fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.87,0:20:09.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,想走就走吧 没关系的\N{\fnArial\fs30}If it's time to go, it's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.65,0:20:19.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸 我只想谢谢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Daddy, I just want to thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.98,0:20:24.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有的一切都谢谢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}For everything, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.95,0:21:06.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里太暗了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Man, it's too damn dark in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.83,0:21:09.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,武器在面前举高\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gotta hold it up high out in front of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.53,0:21:11.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看到它们之前能听到声音\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna hear them before you see them.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.81,0:21:20.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.46,0:22:29.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为你在整理食物\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought you were organizing the food.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.95,0:22:31.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,比那更好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even better.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.75,0:22:35.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看这些\N{\fnArial\fs30}Check it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.25,0:22:39.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你从哪里找到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where did you get this?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.55,0:22:40.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,从医务室\N{\fnArial\fs30}From the infirmary.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.50,0:22:43.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,剩的不多 但我都拿来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wasn't much left, but I cleared it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.59,0:22:45.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你自己去的吗 - 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You went by yourself? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.28,0:22:47.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你疯了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you crazy?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.60,0:22:49.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,没什么大不了 我杀了两个行尸\N{\fnArial\fs30}No big deal. I killed two walkers.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.25,0:22:53.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你 看到这个了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You… all right, do you see this?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.55,0:22:55.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,这发生在全员都在的情况下\N{\fnArial\fs30}This was with the whole group.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.69,0:22:57.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们需要医用供给 我就去找了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We needed supplies, so I got them.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.26,0:22:59.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我很感谢 但 - 那就别烦老子\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I appreciate that, but… - Then get off my back.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.21,0:23:02.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 卡尔 - 她是你妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Carl! - She's your mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.16,0:23:03.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,别那样跟她说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't talk to her like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.30,0:23:08.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 你想帮忙很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, I think it's great that you wanna help…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.86,0:23:19.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,得冲着脑袋\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's gotta be the brain.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.20,0:23:22.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是肚子 不是心脏 脑袋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not the stomach, not the heart… the brain.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.01,0:23:24.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我听见了 脑袋\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hear you. The brain.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.09,0:23:28.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 像这样吗 - 没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Like that? - Hum-uh.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.72,0:23:39.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,保持队形 这可不是监狱群殴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay in tight formation. No more prison riot crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.11,0:24:50.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,缝几针能防止感染\N{\fnArial\fs30}The stitches will help prevent infection.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.65,0:24:52.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,很不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.38,0:24:55.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,多亏他教了你这些\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's good that he taught you all this stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.67,0:24:58.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,他没教我全部\N{\fnArial\fs30}He didn't teach me everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.57,0:25:06.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要你帮我个忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need your help with something.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.14,0:25:07.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 现在吗 - 现在\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Now? - Yeah, now.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.09,0:25:09.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.00,0:25:11.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,出去说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not here.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.32,0:25:12.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能离开赫谢尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't leave Hershel.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.73,0:25:15.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这很重要 - 卡萝尔 我不能\N{\fnArial\fs30}- This is important. - Carol, I can't…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.51,0:25:17.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 去吧 有我们 - 不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Go on. We got it. - No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.29,0:25:18.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.90,0:25:19.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们很快就回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're not gonna be gone long.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.88,0:25:21.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 瑞克说我得… - 我们没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Rick said for me… - We're fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.66,0:25:29.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,那好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alright.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.74,0:25:40.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说了 什么感觉都没有 只是抓伤\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm telling you, I don't feel anything. It's just a scratch.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.54,0:25:42.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 对不起伙计 - 我可以继续战斗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm sorry, man. - I can keep fighting!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.43,0:25:44.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不是把那老头腿砍了救命吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You cut that old guy's leg off to save his life.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.67,0:25:46.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你们看咬伤在哪 - 伙计们我没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Look at where the bite is. - Guys, I'm fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.96,0:25:49.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just… I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.12,0:25:52.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看我 我不会变成行尸的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at me… I'm not changing into one of those things.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.82,0:25:54.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着伙计 我们肯定能做些什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, man, there has to be something we can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.64,0:25:56.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们可以把他关起来 - 隔离他\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Maybe we can just lock him up. - Quarantine him.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.84,0:25:59.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们必须做点什么 你们怎么都傻站着\N{\fnArial\fs30}We gotta do something. Why you just standing there?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.28,0:26:01.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们必须救他 - 我们没什么能做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We gotta save him. - There's nothing we can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.52,0:26:03.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,狗杂种\N{\fnArial\fs30}You son of a bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.77,0:26:04.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没事…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm all ri…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.42,0:27:04.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的想法是正常的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything you're saying is completely sane.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.12,0:27:09.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,用行尸做练习没什么不对\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're wanting to use a walker for practice is a sane thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.86,0:27:11.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是认真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean it, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.30,0:27:14.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是需要点时间接受\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just… I'm just trying to wrap my mind around it.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.70,0:27:18.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,洛莉已经晚产了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lori's overdue.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.40,0:27:19.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,她剖腹产下卡尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}She had Carl by C-section.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.59,0:27:22.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个孩子很可能也要剖腹产\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's probably gonna have to have this one the same way.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.44,0:27:24.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,赫谢尔有些经验\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hershel had a little bit of exprience.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.00,0:27:26.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,但他现在肯定没法做了\N{\fnArial\fs30}but he's not gonna be able to do it anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.06,0:27:28.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要经验\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need experience.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.87,0:27:30.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,刚好又有很多死尸\N{\fnArial\fs30}and we have plenty of cadavers.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.77,0:27:36.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 如我所说 这没什么不对\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, well, like I said, it's completely sane.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.13,0:27:40.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要学习如何在不伤害婴儿的情况下\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need to learn how to cut through the abdomen and the uterus.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.54,0:27:42.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,切开腹部和子宫\N{\fnArial\fs30}without cutting the baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.49,0:27:43.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,为何不呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.08,0:27:47.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.16,0:27:51.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.02,0:28:06.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟我来 来啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, follow me. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.97,0:28:10.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,这边 过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right here, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.35,0:28:11.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟我来 这就对了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Follow me. That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.97,0:28:14.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧 快啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}There we go. Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.88,0:28:33.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看到他神情了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see the look on his face?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.11,0:28:36.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果他敢图谋不轨\N{\fnArial\fs30}He makes one move.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.04,0:28:37.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你吭一声我就干掉他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just give me a signal.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.72,0:29:11.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我才不开门 - 你必须开\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I ain't open to that. - Yes, you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.65,0:29:14.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你想要这个牢房区\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you want this cell block,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.27,0:29:16.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,就得开门\N{\fnArial\fs30}you're gonna open that door.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.25,0:29:19.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,只开一扇 别开两扇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just the one, not both of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.60,0:29:21.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我们要控制住形势\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because we need to control this.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.29,0:29:43.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备好了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You bitches ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.72,0:29:50.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,别担心\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got this.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.37,0:29:55.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我说了只开一扇 - 世事无常嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I said one door! - Shit happens.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.09,0:30:23.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,T仔 补位\N{\fnArial\fs30}T, mind the gap.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.11,0:30:38.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,它朝我扑来 老兄\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was coming at me, bro.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.76,0:30:40.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 我懂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, yeah, I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.65,0:30:42.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我懂\N{\fnArial\fs30}I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.40,0:30:46.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,世事无常\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit happens.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.36,0:30:56.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.14,0:31:03.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,别动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Easy now.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.53,0:31:07.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我追他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got him.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.72,0:31:11.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,跪下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Man, get down on your knees.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.49,0:31:16.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们跟刚才的事毫无关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't have no affiliation to what just happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.15,0:31:18.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,快告诉他 奥斯卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell him, Oscar.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.98,0:31:20.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,别说了 老兄\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop talking, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.36,0:32:04.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我进去 让我进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me back in, man. Let me back in!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.25,0:32:05.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,开门啊老兄 开门\N{\fnArial\fs30}Open it up, man! Open up!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.97,0:32:08.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你最好跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'd better run.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.18,0:33:10.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.17,0:33:17.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,做点什么啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do something!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.68,0:33:20.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,来人啊 救命啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Somebody help! Somebody!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.68,0:33:22.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,救命啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please help!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.22,0:33:41.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,快啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.08,0:33:46.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,快啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.88,0:33:53.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.33,0:34:14.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,那事与我们无关\N{\fnArial\fs30}We ain't had nothing to do with that.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.97,0:34:16.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不知道吗 你肯定知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}You didn't know? You knew.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.95,0:34:18.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,达里尔 现在就一了百了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Daryl, let's end this now.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.77,0:34:20.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,先生 求你了 一定要听我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir, sir, you gotta listen to me, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.49,0:34:22.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,是阿克塞尔的主意 他是坏人 与我们无关\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was Axel, he was bad. It was't us.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.25,0:34:25.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你们想得倒美 - 你看到他对大块头做了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, that's convenient. - You saw what he did to Tiny.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.74,0:34:27.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是我死党\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was my friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.71,0:34:30.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你了 我们和他不同\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, we ain't like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.13,0:34:33.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我喜欢摆弄药品 但我不会杀人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I like my pharmaceuticals, but I'm no killer.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.12,0:34:35.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,奥斯卡是修理工\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oscar here is a beater.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.61,0:34:37.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,他也不会杀人\N{\fnArial\fs30}and he ain't very good at it neither.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.87,0:34:40.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不是嗜血杀手 他们才是\N{\fnArial\fs30}We ain't the violent kind, they were!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.52,0:34:44.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你了 我发誓是真的 我不想死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, I swear to God! I wanna live!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.30,0:34:59.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about you?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.61,0:35:01.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我过去从未求人饶命\N{\fnArial\fs30}I ain't never pleaded for my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.55,0:35:05.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在也不会\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I ain't about to start now.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.24,0:35:09.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,要杀要刮随你\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you do what you gotta do.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.98,0:35:25.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,天呐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.70,0:35:33.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我认识这些人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I knew these guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.50,0:35:38.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们都是好人\N{\fnArial\fs30}These were good men.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.99,0:35:42.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.46,0:35:45.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就把我们丢在这里吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you're just gonna Let'sleave us in here?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.61,0:35:46.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,这太残酷了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Man, this is sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.70,0:35:48.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会封锁这片牢房\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're locking down this cell block.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.32,0:35:50.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,从现在开始 监狱的这部分属于你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}From now on, this part of the prison is yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.91,0:35:52.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,爱要不要 这是当初的约定\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take it or leave it. That was the deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.11,0:35:57.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以为这残酷\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think this is cruel?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.10,0:35:59.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,外面的世界更残酷\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't wanna know what's outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.05,0:36:03.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们已经很幸运了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Consider yourselves the lucky ones.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:05.23,0:36:06.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你朋友的事我很遗憾\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry about your friends, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:13.82,0:36:15.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,给个小建议\N{\fnArial\fs30}A word of advice…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.10,0:36:20.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,把尸体抬出去 烧掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}take those bodies outside and burn them.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.15,0:36:45.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,赫谢尔刚没呼吸了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hershel stopped breathing.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.29,0:36:47.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈救了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mom saved him.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.00,0:36:49.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.54,0:36:57.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,没发烧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Still no fever.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.66,0:37:56.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Daddy?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.83,0:38:00.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Daddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.49,0:38:07.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Daddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.57,0:39:03.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.67,0:40:25.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们明天开始清理\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll start cleaning momorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.33,0:40:29.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 这样卡尔就能\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, we'll give Carl a safe place to.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:31.21,0:40:32.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,安全的生活了\N{\fnArial\fs30}do whatever he does these days.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:37.00,0:40:40.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要知道 我从不认为你是个坏母亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}For the record, I… I don't think you're a bad mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.90,0:40:45.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是个坏妻子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, wife is a different story.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.12,0:40:52.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,正如誓言所说 「不论好坏」\N{\fnArial\fs30}For better or worse, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:55.45,0:40:57.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们该怎么办 雇律师\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, what are we gonna do… hire lawyers.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:57.18,0:40:59.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后离婚 分财产吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}and get divorced and split our assets?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:02.45,0:41:05.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们找到了食物 救了赫谢尔的命\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got food. Hershel's alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:05.21,0:41:06.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天是个好日子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Today was a good day.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:08.30,0:41:10.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果不是你 他就死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He'd be dead if it weren't for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:11.87,0:41:13.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是最先反应过来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're the one that acted fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:13.34,0:41:15.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你没有对他截肢…\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you hadn't done what you did, then…
Dialogue: 0,0:41:26.20,0:41:28.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还以为你是来聊我们的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought maybe you were coming out here to talk about us.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:34.21,0:41:36.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许我们间已没什么好说了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe there's nothing to talk about anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:55.06,0:41:57.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们很感激你所做的一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're awful grateful for what you did.
